# Files in this repo that are NOT part of the website.
#
# Vercel serves every file it is given, publicly, at its path. Before this file
# existed, awardsandengraving.com/CLIENT-MEETING-PREP.md and every database
# migration (including the row-level security policies that protect the data)
# were readable by anyone. The site needs none of them: it is static HTML, the
# functions in api/, and assets/.

# Internal notes and write-ups
*.md

# Database migrations: run by hand in the Supabase SQL editor, never served
supabase/

# Local tooling: the preview server and the api/_shell.js generator.
# api/_shell.js itself is generated INTO api/ and is still deployed.
tools/

# Catalog scraper scripts that produce assets/catalog/
assets/*.py
